## 2. chs_rt link surface

### 2.1 The umbrella
oda/runtime/chs_rt.c lines 1 to 41 #include the 40 runtime translation units. The build command (ooda_pure_build line 349) passes only chs_rt.c to gcc. The umbrella is the only entry gcc sees; the 40 files are textual #include.

40 files in umbrella (alphabetical):
chs_rt_actor.c, chs_rt_alloc.c, chs_rt_arena.c, chs_rt_caps.c, chs_rt_channel.c, chs_rt_crypto.c, chs_rt_dns.c, chs_rt_emit_tmp.c, chs_rt_fetch.c, chs_rt_ffi.c, chs_rt_ffi_sec.c, chs_rt_flist.c, chs_rt_fs.c, chs_rt_hash.c, chs_rt_hitl.c, chs_rt_host.c, chs_rt_landlock.c, chs_rt_libfloor.c, chs_rt_list.c, chs_rt_llist.c, chs_rt_llist_f.c, chs_rt_llist_s.c, chs_rt_math.c, chs_rt_meta.c, chs_rt_netfloor.c, chs_rt_print.c, chs_rt_rlimit.c, chs_rt_sys.c, chs_rt_thread.c, chs_rt_time_rand.c, chs_rt_tls.c, chs_rt_vision.c, chs_rt_wasm.c, chs_rt_wasm_print.c, chs_rt_xlang.c, chs_rt_str.c (NOT — see below), chs_rt_str_intern.c, chs_rt_str_int.c, chs_rt_str_ops.c, chs_rt_str_tok.c.

### 2.2 Stragglers (on disk, NOT in the umbrella)
- oda/runtime/chs_rt_str.c — only #includes "chs_rt.h"; provides string operations not brought in by chs_rt_str_*.c.
- oda/runtime/chs_rt_list_set.c — no includes; not linked by the official build.
Either file is residual, dead, or compiled outside the umbrella. The Windows port must decide whether to keep, drop, or include them.

### 2.3 Helper objects compiled outside the umbrella
- oda/runtime/oo_sha256.c, oda/runtime/oo_holo.c, oda/runtime/oo_hide.c — Path-A immune units, per oda/.gitignore lines 46 to 48. Not referenced by the umbrella. Compiled in separately when the host links the corresponding feature.

## 3. Host header includes

### 3.1 Headers emitted by the C emitter (ooda/oodac/c_emit_preamble.oo lines 13 to 18)
stdio.h, stdlib.h, string.h, stdbool.h, stddef.h, unistd.h. Every C-emit translation unit gets these. On Windows, unistd.h is replaced by io.h (or omitted if mingw provides a shim).

